    "introduction": "\"Nont\" Sadanont Durongkavarojana is a Thai actor. After graduating from Bangkok Christian College in 2019, he went on to studyy at Bangkok University's School of Digital Media and Cinematic Arts.Prior to his debut as an actor in the 2019 Thai film \"Dew\" (ดิว ไปด้วยกันนะ), Nont appeared in music videos such as Getsunova's \"Khue Thoe Chai Mai\" (คือเธอใช่ไหม) and Dome Pakorn Lam's \"Siang Kho Rong Khong Khon Siajai\" (เสียงขอร้องของคนเสียใจ).For his performance in \"Dew,\" Nont won four awards, namely Best Supporting Actor at the 16th Kom Chad Luek Awards; Best Actor at the 17th Starpics Thai Film Awards; Best Actor at the 28th Bangkok Critics Assembly Awards; and Best Actor in the 29th Thailand National Film Association (Suphannahong National Film) Awards.",
